 NOT FOR MANUFACTURE OR FULL-CURRENT TEST" (at 20 153 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6ad96aec-8d6b-51f5-9b33-f328e0f575af)) (text "1. One cell is one-sixth of the future 220 A RMS module: about 51.9 A peak with ideal sinusoidal sharing." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid fcfa414e-a372-545f-9e5a-0248f289be6e)) (text "2. QH1 / QL1 symbol exposes every package pad: 1 gate; 2,4,6 source; 3,5,7 drain. No separate Kelvin package pin." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 477c53d9-f795-5f1d-b571-ac10cdc71f22)) (text "3. Gate return must take off at the source pad nearest the gate; copper geometry defines Kelvin performance." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0f02eef1-7e94-5e3d-8792-4562688a09ad)) (text "4. Cold plate contacts the source-connected FET tops through insulating TIM. Driver circuitry is external." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid e683f5b9-7d74-5dd6-b78d-bda5bf60fcea)) (text "5. Port pads and driver pads are interface placeholders, not selected/rated connectors. RG values require driver tuning." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid a6e14850-5701-5c0f-9aa0-4a646d44ca12)) (text "6. Verify VDS overshoot, capacitance bias/ripple, current sharing, coolant conditions and completed routing before release." (at 20 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 663e7c8f-5ce2-554d-88af-46667f23fb7d)))